<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@/~cl_27__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Where any person is found guilty of an offence under section 15, 40 or 86, the court shall, in addition to any other penalty that may be imposed, order that any licence or permit issued under this Act in relation to which the offence has been committed be revoked."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@/~cl_27__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@/~cl_27> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@/~cl_27__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@/~cl_27__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@/~cl_27__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Where any person to whom a licence or permit has been issued under this Act is charged with and found guilty of a second or subsequent offence under this Act, the court shall, in addition to any other penalty that may be imposed, order that any licence or permit issued under this Act in relation to which the offence has been committed be revoked."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@/~cl_27__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@/~cl_27> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@/~cl_27__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@/~cl_27__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@/~cl_27__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Where any licence or permit has been revoked under this section, the court shall order that such person to whom a licence or permit has been issued be disqualified from holding any licence or permit for a period not exceeding five years."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@/~cl_27__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@/~cl_27> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@/~cl_27__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "5" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@/~cl_27__subsec_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@/~cl_27__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who obtains or attempts to obtain any licence or permit under this Act while he is so disqualified shall be guilty of an offence.\"."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@/~cl_28> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@> .
