<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@/~cl_8__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for the words \"ten thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding three years or to both such fine and imprisonment\" in subsection (2) the words \"five hundred thousand ringgit and imprisonment for a term which shall not be less than one year but shall not exceed twenty years\";"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/19/eng@> .
